b-cli-2c[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Start the next future Pomodoro from capture with =<X>[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A whole capture item `=<X>` starts today's next future Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with the same `se<X>` timing as `@route:block-id=<X>`, only when a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]future Pomodoro exists and none is running, and Bob CLI and Bob Mac[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Capture preview (including the session's queued tasks) and apply it[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with identical, atomic results.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pomodoro_start_next_operator.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/pomodoro_start_next_operator.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-2c[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-2c/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parse and atomically apply whole-item Pomodoro starts[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]start_core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]start_core: add the shared `=`-family lexer, CaptureKind::PomodoroStart,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the staged next-future-Pomodoro planner with its guards and error copy, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON/human output, the shared selection helper, the \"start it with `=`\" [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hints, and CLI tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Report the started session's queued Task Links[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]start_lineup[dim] · [dim][/dim]after start_core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]start_lineup: list and read-only resolve the started entry's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]direct-child Task Links through the close planner's vault view, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report them as `pomodoro_start.tasks` rows and human lineup lines.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Expose and document the Pomodoro start editor contract[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editor_contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after start_lineup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor_contract: teach capture-parse, completion, and rewrite the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]whole-item start (mode, span, spec, diagnostics, @@ skip), update help, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/capture.md, and README with the lifecycle table and zsh quoting, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and add protocol tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Preview and submit Pomodoro starts in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_start[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editor_contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_start: tolerant start decoding, a play-glyph start card with queued [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks, the Start footer action, notifications, real-bob fixtures [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]replacing the `=` incomplete fixtures, tests, README, and green macOS [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CI.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-2c","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-2c.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-831a0489e0c3a37c0b5d3c2179692d52","started_at":"2026-09-28T16:19:34.029026+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"mis